<title>UK: London fertiliser fixtures.</title>
<headline>London fertiliser fixtures.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-05-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Anna - 25,000 tonnes urea Yuzhnyy, Odessa or Novorossisk/India $32 fio 6,000/1,200 21-26/5 Indian government.</p>
